        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium metasilicate pentahydrate, 58%, powder, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium metasilicate pentahydrate, 58%, powder, at plant
data based on a EMPA study, commissioned by the CEES.;
CAS number: 010213-79-3; 
UUID: cb45ad23-7255-3b13-b28c-1625b3de9825
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of sodium metasilicate pentahydrate powder. Transport and infrastructure have been estimated. The input of compressed air is not reported in the data according to the methodology of the study.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average technology used from these European producers
Time period: producer information for production year 1995
Production volume: na
Sampling: sampling of questionnaires 
Extrapolations: see included processes
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cb45ad23-7255-3b13-b28c-1625b3de9825.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
